      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prontera Guide]\nThe {0} is\nwhere you can change your job to Acolyte,\nits located in the far northeast of Prontera.\nLet me mark the location on your mini-map.\n{1}",
      "translation" : "[普隆德拉向導]\n{0}位於普隆德拉東北角，您可以在那裡轉職為服事。\n我會在您的小地圖上標記它的位置。\n{1}"
