        ".@str$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prontera Guide]\nThe ^0000FFLibrary^000000 is\nwhere you can find useful information, like the Monster Encyclopedia.\nThere are currently two libaries available,\nOne to the {0} and the other to the {1}.\n{2}",
      "translation" : "[普隆德拉向導]\n在^0000FF圖書館^000000可以查到魔物圖鑑等有用的資訊。\n目前有兩座圖書館，一座在{0}，另一座在{1}。\n{2}"
    },
