      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Prontera Castle\",\"prontera,156,360\",\"^FF5400\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prontera Guide]\nThe {0} is north from here,\nand its rear gate is connected to\nthe northern Prontera Fields.\nLet me mark the castle on your mini-map.\n{1}",
      "translation" : "[普隆德拉向導]\n{0}就在這裡的北邊，後門通往普隆德拉北郊。\n我會在您的小地圖上標記王宮的位置。\n{1}"
